{"c":[{"name":"20260820T203140Z-2cd50a583de58b13","text":"SumMem installed from Texarkanine/SumMem@78d91b7; one store only (repo-root .summem). Do not start scoped stores.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T203952Z-b85700bde1651227","text":"TDD/preflight must judge product-delivered or product-runtime behavior, not whatever a package manager or Actions runner executes (#116). Prefer one steering principle over an exclusion list of tools.","type":"note"}]}
